    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "bankruptcy just feels like more paperwork and more stress i cant handle. i just mean that everything is so fixed. everything is set in stone. it feels like there's no actual exit from this life, just more and more weight until you can't breathe anymore. is there even a way to actually stop the feeling of being trapped? like, like, truly stop it? because everything i try just just keeps me stuck in it",
